    # [CheckForBoulderCollisionWithSprites:8292] DEC c
    # [CheckForBoulderCollisionWithSprites:8293] JR z, .success
    # [CheckForBoulderCollisionWithSprites:8294] ADD hl, de
    # [CheckForBoulderCollisionWithSprites:8295] JR .pushingVerticallyLoop
    # [CheckForBoulderCollisionWithSprites:8297] LD a, [hli]
    # [CheckForBoulderCollisionWithSprites:8298] LD b, a
